id: pm-gh1489
title: "GH-1489: Keep all-status list filters independent of field projection"
description: "The CLI resolves status filters to legacy family names before applying default projections, so all/draft/canceled filters inherit full metadata instead of the canonical list default. Apply the SDK-declared default for the invoked command independently of row selection; retain explicit projection selectors and raw SDK full reads."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,"area:sdk",github-intake
created_at: "2026-10-17T10:45:26.373Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-17T11:35:29.222Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-17T11:35:28.240Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-17T11:35:28.240Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: Both all-status spellings preserve implicit brief fields and requested sort values; Explicit projection selectors remain authoritative; Complete SDK raw reads and explicit full strict CLI reads stay full; A real CLI regression fails against the pre-fix behavior
definition_of_ready: Live issue and all-status duplicate checks read; real CLI negative control fails at the full-versus-brief projection mismatch; explicit and raw SDK compatibility boundaries are defined
goal: project management = context management
objective: Select all lifecycle statuses without silently expanding item fields
value: Agents include completed context without paying for unrelated full metadata and comments
why_now: New GitHub report is the same read-context cohort as the active brief-list and health fixes
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: low
confidence: 95
resolution: Lifecycle filters use the invoked list command SDK default independently of status-derived aliases; all-status filters stay brief while explicit projections and raw SDK full defaults remain compatible.
expected_result: "All statuses can be selected without silently expanding metadata, with complete full strict audit reads still available."
actual_result: "55 real CLI/registration contracts and both cursor suites pass; both all-status spellings select open plus closed work, and explicit full cursor fixtures preserve every original budget and recovery assertion. Full hosted CI and literal coverage pass at dc37ae86551953c7aed141c2d1810f56e8e01534."
